  unitName: Storm Chieftess Mahalu
  unitId: 40616
  unitNumber: 1050
  description: The disciple who bestowed one of the Sacred Treasures upon a human.
    The two treasures she came to mold did not hold much power at first. It was not
    until she was persecuted by the gods that the power of the treasures began to
    grow amidst their long battle. There are tales that claim Mahalu sought this
    dispute with the gods for the very purpose of strengthening the treasures she
    held, and that she only used humans in order to accomplish this goal. However,
    many refute such heinous claims citing the words she left behind when she gifted
    Duran with the Sacred Blade.
  summonDesc: I think I wronged him.<br>What I did bound his life to mine.<br>I just
    wanted to save humanity...
  fusionDesc: I think it's nice that you're<br>aiming so high up.<br>I mean that
    as a compliment.
  evoDesc: Thank you...<br>You've made me stronger...<br>Let's go forth together...
  element: 4
  rarity: 6
